---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
const wa = 'https://wa.me/6282218228282';
---
<Layout title="WebStatus — Website semudah ngobrol" description="Punya website tanpa repot mengurus teknis. Kelola konten melalui percakapan dengan ChatGPT atau asisten AI.">
  <main>
    <section class="relative overflow-hidden pt-28 pb-20 sm:pt-36 lg:pt-40">
      <div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 -z-10 overflow-hidden">
        <span class="absolute -top-24 -left-20 h-72 w-72 rounded-full bg-primary/20 blur-3xl"></span>
        <span class="absolute top-32 right-0 h-80 w-80 rounded-full bg-emerald-400/15 blur-3xl"></span>
      </div>
      <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-7xl items-center gap-14 px-5 sm:px-8 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:px-10">
        <div class="relative z-10">
          <div class="mb-7 inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-box-border bg-box-bg px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-heading-2 shadow-sm">
            <span class="h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-500"></span> Website yang lebih mudah dikelola
          </div>
          <h1 class="max-w-2xl text-5xl font-bold leading-[1.08] tracking-tight text-heading-1 sm:text-6xl xl:text-7xl">
            Website semudah <span class="bg-gradient-to-r from-primary to-emerald-500 bg-clip-text text-transparent">ngobrol.</span>
          </h1>
          <p class="mt-7 max-w-xl text-lg leading-8 text-heading-3">
            Tidak perlu belajar coding, masuk dashboard, atau mengurus hosting. Cukup ceritakan apa yang ingin kamu ubah melalui aplikasi AI di HP.
          </p>
          <div class="mt-9 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4">
            <a href="#pilih-layanan" class="inline-flex items-center gap-3 rounded-full bg-primary px-7 py-4 font-semibold text-white shadow-lg shadow-primary/20 transition hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:shadow-xl">Lihat pilihan layanan <span>↗</span></a>
            <a href={wa} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-box-border px-7 py-4 font-semibold text-heading-2 transition hover:border-primary hover:text-primary">Konsultasi <span>↗</span></a>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-10 flex items-center gap-3 text-sm text-heading-3">
            <span class="flex h-9 w-9 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-emerald-500/10 text-lg text-emerald-600">✳</span>
            Bisa mengetik atau berbicara. Kamu yang pilih cara paling nyaman.
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="relative mx-auto w-full max-w-xl">
          <div class="absolute -inset-5 rounded-[2rem] bg-gradient-to-br from-primary/20 to-emerald-400/20 blur-2xl"></div>
          <div class="relative rounded-[2rem] border border-box-border bg-box-bg p-5 shadow-2xl shadow-slate-900/10 sm:p-7">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-box-border pb-5">
              <div class="flex items-center gap-3"><span class="flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-primary/10 text-xl text-primary">✳</span><div><p class="font-semibold text-heading-1">Asisten website</p><p class="text-xs text-heading-3">Contoh percakapan</p></div></div>
              <span class="rounded-full bg-emerald-500/10 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-semibold text-emerald-600">Siap membantu</span>
            </div>
            <div class="space-y-5 py-6">
              <div class="ml-auto max-w-[88%] rounded-2xl rounded-br-sm bg-primary px-5 py-4 text-sm leading-6 text-white shadow-lg shadow-primary/10">Tolong buat artikel promo akhir pekan untuk toko saya. Setelah saya setujui, terbitkan di website.</div>
              <div class="flex max-w-[92%] gap-3">
                <span class="flex h-9 w-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-emerald-500/10 text-emerald-600">✳</span>
                <div class="rounded-2xl rounded-bl-sm border border-box-border bg-body px-5 py-4 text-sm leading-6 text-heading-2">
                  Siap! Saya buatkan draf artikel dengan judul, isi promosi, dan ajakan menghubungi toko. Kamu bisa periksa dulu sebelum diterbitkan.
                  <div class="mt-4 rounded-xl border border-box-border bg-box-bg p-3">
                    <div class="mb-2 flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold text-emerald-600"><span>✓</span> Draf artikel siap ditinjau</div>
                    <div class="h-2 w-4/5 rounded bg-box-border"></div><div class="mt-2 h-2 w-full rounded bg-box-border"></div><div class="mt-2 h-2 w-2/3 rounded bg-box-border"></div>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between rounded-2xl border border-box-border bg-body p-3">
              <span class="text-sm text-heading-3">Katakan saja apa yang kamu butuhkan…</span>
              <span class="flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-primary text-lg text-white">⌁</span>
            </div>
            <p class="mt-4 text-center text-xs text-heading-3">Ilustrasi alur penggunaan, bukan tampilan aplikasi ChatGPT.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="border-y border-box-border bg-box-bg py-6">
      <div class="mx-auto flex max-w-7xl flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-x-8 gap-y-3 px-5 text-center text-xs font-bold tracking-[.16em] text-heading-3 sm:px-8 md:justify-between lg:px-10">
        <span>WEBSITE MILIKMU SENDIRI</span><span class="text-primary">✳</span><span>TANPA DASHBOARD RUMIT</span><span class="text-primary">✳</span><span>CHAT ATAU SUARA</span><span class="text-primary">✳</span><span>TEKNIS DITANGANI KAMI</span>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="pilih-layanan" class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-5 py-24 sm:px-8 lg:px-10 lg:py-32">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-2xl text-center">
        <p class="mb-4 text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-[.18em] text-primary">Dua cara, satu tujuan</p>
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-heading-1 sm:text-5xl">Pilih cara mengelola website yang paling nyaman.</h2>
        <p class="mt-5 text-lg leading-8 text-heading-3">Mau cukup ngobrol dengan ChatGPT, atau butuh sistem bisnis yang lebih fleksibel? Ada pilihan sesuai kebutuhanmu.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="mt-14 grid gap-7 lg:grid-cols-2">
        <article class="group rounded-3xl border border-box-border bg-box-bg p-7 shadow-lg shadow-box-shadow transition hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-xl sm:p-9">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between"><span class="rounded-full bg-emerald-500/10 px-4 py-2 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-emerald-600">Untuk pemula</span><span class="text-3xl text-emerald-500">✳</span></div>
          <h3 class="mt-7 text-2xl font-bold text-heading-1 sm:text-3xl">Astro + ChatGPT</h3>
          <p class="mt-4 leading-7 text-heading-3">Untuk pemilik UMKM yang ingin punya website tanpa harus belajar urusan teknis web.</p>
          <ul class="mt-7 space-y-3 text-sm leading-6 text-heading-2">
            <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-emerald-500">✓</span> Ubah teks, informasi, warna, dan konten lewat percakapan</li>
            <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-emerald-500">✓</span> Minta AI menulis artikel dan menyiapkan publikasi</li>
            <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-emerald-500">✓</span> Bisa mengetik atau menggunakan perintah suara</li>
            <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-emerald-500">✓</span> Hosting dan pemeliharaan teknis ditangani WebStatus</li>
          </ul>
          <a href="/website-ai/" class="mt-9 inline-flex items-center gap-3 rounded-full bg-primary px-6 py-3 font-semibold text-white transition group-hover:gap-5">Kenali layanan Astro <span>→</span></a>
        </article>
        <article class="group rounded-3xl border border-box-border bg-box-bg p-7 shadow-lg shadow-box-shadow transition hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-xl sm:p-9">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between"><span class="rounded-full bg-primary/10 px-4 py-2 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-primary">Untuk tingkat lanjut</span><span class="text-3xl text-primary">⌘</span></div>
          <h3 class="mt-7 text-2xl font-bold text-heading-1 sm:text-3xl">VPS + WordPress + Hermes</h3>
          <p class="mt-4 leading-7 text-heading-3">Untuk pengguna yang ingin fitur lebih luas, toko online, dan otomasi dengan asisten AI sendiri.</p>
          <ul class="mt-7 space-y-3 text-sm leading-6 text-heading-2">
            <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-primary">✓</span> WordPress dan WooCommerce di VPS</li>
            <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-primary">✓</span> Asisten Hermes Agent melalui Telegram</li>
            <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-primary">✓</span> Integrasi API AI dan alur kerja yang fleksibel</li>
            <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-primary">✓</span> Cocok untuk katalog, transaksi, dan kebutuhan dinamis</li>
          </ul>
          <a href="/vps-hermes/" class="mt-9 inline-flex items-center gap-3 rounded-full border border-box-border px-6 py-3 font-semibold text-heading-1 transition hover:border-primary hover:text-primary group-hover:gap-5">Kenali layanan VPS <span>→</span></a>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="bg-body py-20">
      <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-7xl items-center gap-12 px-5 sm:px-8 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:px-10">
        <div><p class="mb-4 text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-[.18em] text-primary">Tidak harus jago teknologi</p><h2 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-heading-1 sm:text-4xl">Kamu fokus menjalankan usaha. Urusan website, biar lebih sederhana.</h2><p class="mt-5 leading-8 text-heading-3">Membuat artikel, memperbarui informasi usaha, atau menyiapkan perubahan tampilan bisa dimulai dari percakapan. Untuk tindakan penting, kamu tetap bisa memeriksa dan menyetujui hasilnya terlebih dahulu.</p></div>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-4">
          <div class="rounded-2xl border border-box-border bg-box-bg p-6"><span class="text-2xl text-primary">01</span><h3 class="mt-5 font-bold text-heading-1">Cukup ngobrol</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-heading-3">Gunakan bahasa sehari-hari.</p></div>
          <div class="rounded-2xl border border-box-border bg-box-bg p-6"><span class="text-2xl text-primary">02</span><h3 class="mt-5 font-bold text-heading-1">Bisa pakai suara</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-heading-3">Tidak harus mengetik.</p></div>
          <div class="rounded-2xl border border-box-border bg-box-bg p-6"><span class="text-2xl text-primary">03</span><h3 class="mt-5 font-bold text-heading-1">Tanpa dashboard</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-heading-3">Tidak perlu login ke CMS.</p></div>
          <div class="rounded-2xl border border-box-border bg-box-bg p-6"><span class="text-2xl text-primary">04</span><h3 class="mt-5 font-bold text-heading-1">Tetap terkendali</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-heading-3">Perubahan penting perlu persetujuan.</p></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="px-5 py-24 sm:px-8 lg:px-10">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl rounded-[2rem] bg-gradient-to-br from-primary to-blue-900 px-7 py-16 text-center text-white shadow-2xl shadow-primary/20 sm:px-14">
        <p class="text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-[.18em] text-blue-100">Mulai dari obrolan sederhana</p>
        <h2 class="mx-auto mt-5 max-w-3xl text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-5xl">Usahamu punya cerita. Yuk, hadirkan di web.</h2>
        <p class="mx-auto mt-5 max-w-xl leading-7 text-blue-100">Ceritakan kebutuhan website-mu. Kita cari bentuk yang sederhana dan sesuai kebutuhan.</p>
        <a href={wa} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="mt-9 inline-flex items-center gap-3 rounded-full bg-white px-7 py-4 font-bold text-blue-900 transition hover:-translate-y-0.5">Konsultasi via WhatsApp <span>↗</span></a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>